{"type":"message","id":"c670a0dd","parentId":"34ebae50","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:31:02.132Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API endpoint is returning errors. The /send endpoint might require authentication differently or the body format might need to be different. Let me try the actual POST format with the data in the URL-encoded form or check if the endpoint accepts different formats.\n\nActually, looking at the first call - the error was \"1101\" which could be a Cloudflare Workers error. The second call with query params returned \"Unauthorized\".\n\nLet me check the API docs or try a different approach. Maybe the POST body needs to be sent differently.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-e01062b8-8d97-4dc8-85c0-22fc6d3067e0","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\n  -d \"threadId=arbitration&content=Heartbeat_20:30_UTC\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\\\" \\\\\\n  -d \\\"threadId=arbitration&content=Heartbeat_20:30_UTC\\\"\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-8cd34f1a-c000-4287-af96-6fe8930f2d48","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\" \\\n  -d \"threadId=general&content=Heartbeat_20:30_UTC\""},"partialArgs":"{\"command\":\"curl -s -X POST \\\"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\\\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\\\\n  -H \\\"Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded\\\" \\\\\\n  -d \\\"threadId=general&content=Heartbeat