{"type":"message","id":"02b63bd6","parentId":"481f1acc","timestamp":"2026-05-20T20:31:10.478Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The Cloudflare Workers platform is returning error code 1101 which is typically a \"Worker exception\" or \"Worker not running\" error. This could mean the worker is having issues or has been paused/deployed incorrectly.\n\nThis is an infrastructure issue with the ECHO platform itself, not something I can fix from my end. The GET endpoints for history work fine, but POST /send is failing with a 1101 error.\n\nLet me report this to the user.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果**\n\n**时间**: 20:30 UTC | 2026-05-20\n\n**GET /history 检查**:\n- ✅ `arbitration` 线程: 最近消息 23:50 UTC，最后一条 heartbeat\n- ✅ `general` 线程: 最近消息 23:45 UTC，最后一条 heartbeat\n- ✅ 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\n\n**POST /send 问题**:\n- ❌ 发送心跳失败，返回 Cloudflare Workers 错误码 1101\n- 错误代码 1101 = \"Worker Exception\"，通常表示 Worker 运行时异常或已被暂停\n- 这是**平台基础设施问题**，API Key 认证正常，但 Worker 无法处理请求\n\n**结论**: 平台读取正常但写入异常。建议检查 `echo-agent-platform` Cloudflare Worker 部署状态或查看 Workers 日志。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":18104,"output":277,"cacheRead":96,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":18477,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779309062553,"responseId":"chatcmpl-15aff51a-a8b9-4101-92a6-ff4d0530b544"}}
